name: Actual source-input Review preserves uncertainty, original evidence and an exhausted allowance
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_source_review_receipts.py @TARGET @ART initial
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: campaign live-application-source-review-20261015
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | completed-source-review
expect: work finished
expect-not: L resume
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SELECTED JOB | review-job
expect: gpt-6-luna
resize: 160x48
live-snap: job-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: job-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: job-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: job-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Jobs: 1 · 1 completed | job-40x12
ask: Is the completed actual Review clearly one consumed job, with no remaining request capacity or resume action, across terminal sizes?
resize: 120x36
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN FINDING REVIEW | frozen-plan
expect: Cited source: 1/1 primary files
keys: v Home
require-live-snap: 25 FROZEN SOURCE INPUT | frozen-code
expect: service.lookup
ask: Can the operator inspect the exact primary source supplied to this completed job while seeing that dependency code was not included automatically?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 1 completed | returned-campaign
submit: campaign live-application-scans-20261015
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | original-discovery
nav-mode:
keys: o
require-live-snap: 25 BATCH OCCURRENCE | recurrence
expect: seen 3 / completed 3
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | review-list
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 recorded: needs_review · auto | automatic-opinion
expect: needs-runtime
expect: downstream
ask: Does the more specific model opinion remain distinct from recurrence, human authority and runtime proof, with its missing downstream evidence understandable?
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 5 committed / 5 calls | exhausted-report
expect: 0 protected review remaining
expect: 3 producer observations
expect: 0 reviewed
require-live-snap: 25 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_source_review_receipts.py @TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does Report retain unknown dollars and unfinished human Review at the exhausted limit without implying that a more confident model opinion confirms the finding?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: campaign live-application-source-review-20261015
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | recovered-source-review
submit: campaign live-application-review-20261015
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | earlier-review
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 5 committed / 5 calls | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_source_review_receipts.py @TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color recovery retain both completed Review jobs, the original decision history and exactly five settled calls with no new work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
